# Sanavixx "Endgame Chest" as written (https://sanavixx.com/crafting/, read 2026-11-18):
#   1. Warlord chest: Dominance until the mana-cost mod is elevated with no other suffix;
#      "Suffixes Cannot Be Changed" + scour -> magic item with only that mod.
#   2. Hunter chest: Dominance to elevate T1 "Attacks have +#% to Critical Strike Chance".
#   3. (optional Hinekora preview: see endgame_chest_hinekora.craft) Awakener's Orb.
#   4. Beastcraft "Suffixes Cannot Be Changed", Harvest reforge Caster -> additional Curse
#      with 0-2 extra prefixes; repeat while unhappy and a prefix is still open.
#   5. Six-link beastcraft, Omen of Blanching.
# Bases are crafted from normal influenced Astral Plates (alt -> regal -> "add influenced
# mod" beastcraft -> Dominance); Sanavixx suggests buying them or using conqueror exalts.
include "lib/endgame_chest_parts.craft"

warlord_piece()
hunter_piece()
merge()
curse_reforge()
retry_for_life()
finish()

goal has "Warlord: mana cost" elevated and has "Hunter: attack crit" elevated and has "Hunter: additional curse"
track "life prefix (flat life T1-T2 or Hunter %life)" has "flat life" tier <= 2 or has "Hunter: max life %"
